1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:14,228
One swarm. One day. Three tries.
This is Prism Swarm Daily. Every morning, Reddit gets
the same swarm — same seed, same enemies, for everyone.
Two-minute runs. Best score wins the day.

2
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:26,108
Not ready to spend an attempt? Practice is free.
And on mobile, it's thumb-friendly — joystick on
the left, aim on the right.

3
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:37,972
Match your bullet colour to the enemy, and you deal
triple damage. Wrong colour, and you barely scratch it.
A boss guards every fifth wave.

4
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:53,288
When the clock runs out, your best score hits today's
leaderboard — and one tap shares it as a comment,
so the whole subreddit sees who beat the swarm.
Prism Swarm Daily: a two-minute reason to come back every day.
